From: XR1710G B27 development <local@xr1710g.invalid>
Subject: [PATCH] mt7996: reconstruct retail DRR defaults and MAC weight levels

Use the retail quantum table and AC indices together. Keep WATF separate
from ATF and disabled by default. Optional load-time MAC lists implement
four retail levels without a partially applied runtime table transition.
Explicit numeric mac80211 weights use a documented nearest-quantum
compatibility extension; they are not claimed to be a retail algorithm.
